  "details": "My group is request-to-join only.\n\nEvery once in a while, there is a user who requests to join, and I accept it, and then the notification is gone.\n\nBut then after a few hours or days, their join request reappears. It's not a new one because the timestamp says it's from a few hours, or days ago, etc.\n\nTheir join request just keeps reappearing.\n\nMeanwhile, several others get in just fine.\n\nMy moderation logs on the website are not showing me having accepted their join request at any point in time.\n\nBut I did decline some of them to get it to stop popping up, and it did log me declining it.",
